codex
The launcher issue was isolated to a PID-namespace mismatch: Lean queried `/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe`, while this container exposes the executable at `/proc/self/exe`. A temporary preload shim fixes only that OS path lookup; the pinned Lean 4.22 toolchain and project remain unchanged. The baseline project now builds, with the expected warning for the existing `sorry`.
